{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"63dd0ed1d9ee46f132bb9ddb526d61717a73e311c0ef943a9db750ab30c2f3c4"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:a729af5d16ed32c4395f2fa379961e973c22e6bb3252a06f03039449017aa9a3","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Taking them for walks, watching them, feeding them fruits and vegetables, giving them baths, and bringing them to the beach.","evidence":"[D25:21 | 8:16 pm on 25 October, 2022] Nate: I love seeing them eat fruit - they get so hyped and it's so cute!\n[D25:23 | 8:16 pm on 25 October, 2022] Nate: Yeah, it's adorable! Watching them enjoy their favorite snacks is so fun. I also like holding them.\n[D28:31 | 5:54 pm on 9 November, 2022] Nate: Sounds good. Well I'll make sure I give the turtles a bath before you get here so they're ready to play.","itemId":"urn:uuid:7f8a68a8-c8f6-5565-954e-dae12c2cca2a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:eec67b85f82cd05ed4e5ad179ada529d6f165f06c68920f4700caf1ef246840a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What activities does Nate do with his turtles?","referenceAnswer":"takes them onwalks, holds them,feeds themstrawberries, givesthem baths.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"eec67b85f82cd05ed4e5ad179ada529d6f165f06c68920f4700caf1ef246840a"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}